<title>JAPAN: Takeda Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takeda Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		311.27		vs	  295.91</p>
<p> Operating	   47.22		vs	   40.30</p>
<p> Current	     49.89		vs	   44.40</p>
<p> Net		   24.09		vs	   21.40</p>
<p> EPS		   27.51 yen	  vs	   24.43 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    876 million	  vs	 876 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.25 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Takeda Chemical Industries Ltd is a top pharmaceutical manufacturer.</p>
